{"id":"vod_sn_37407","vodId":"37407","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"境界触发者第一季","name_cn":"境界触发者第一季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/08d454f35f0f7cc3389a02ece42737b3.jpg"},"summary":"拥有28万人口的三门市，其境内某天突然打开了一扇通往未知世界的大门。从大门的另一端，被称为“近界民”的怪物蜂拥而出。人类惊慌失措之余发现，地球现有的武器对近界民完全没有任何效果。危急时刻，神秘团体境界防卫组织“BORDER”出现击退近界民，三门市总算回归往昔的正常生活。如是过了四年半的时间，隐藏着作为“BORDER”成员身份的初中学生三云修（梶裕贵 配音）和转学生空闲游真（村中知 配音）相遇，而对方竟然是来自门另一头的近界民，此行的目的是为了找到自己的父亲。分出不同阵营的二人，注定要在命运的战争中激烈碰撞……　　本片根据苇原大介的同名漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:52:09","playable":true,"episodeCount":73,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/zW6kSttHAq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/yuULf8yANZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/vXr31WkeTx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/kbRNUY95FE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zPis8V5L0g1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cmzi761yuT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/uCwMLHvDpC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/zGHn4Lc4AL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/hdyiB63LRk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/NQ5H3SQHW91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/DcxuuqRxL41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Ec83hPRUqJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Vp9gjKUUsW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/94eB8GFnmm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url